{"name": "Molten Frontier", "w": 1536, "h": 1024, "cell": 4, "walk": "", "zones": [{"x0": 0, "x1": 560, "k": "thalassa"}, {"x0": 560, "x1": 1536, "k": "pyros"}], "nodes": [{"k": "thalassa", "n": "Port Ember", "x": 300, "y": 150}, {"k": "glyphos", "n": "Deep Sea Ferry", "x": 300, "y": 318}, {"k": "bay", "n": "Palm Isle Recovery Hut", "x": 325, "y": 614}, {"k": "dustara", "n": "Tunnel to Sunset Canyon", "x": 687, "y": 300}, {"k": "umbra", "n": "Shadow Tunnel", "x": 840, "y": 526}, {"k": "pyros", "n": "Magma Mines", "x": 1347, "y": 118}, {"k": "helix", "n": "Helix Forge Fortress", "x": 1090, "y": 252}, {"k": "space", "n": "Fortress Launch Pad", "x": 1093, "y": 300}, {"k": "starfall", "n": "Helix Shuttle Pad", "x": 1436, "y": 704}, {"k": "ferrox", "n": "Forge Gate", "x": 873, "y": 790}], "npcs": [{"id": "mf0", "art": "squidsailor", "x": 619, "y": 174, "k": "talk", "t": ["Squid Sailor: The ferry at the end of this dock sails to the Deep Sea Ruins.", "Hop aboard whenever you're ready."]}, {"id": "mf1", "art": "civilian", "x": 619, "y": 169, "k": "talk", "t": ["Villager: Welcome to Port Ember, the last calm shore before the lava fields."]}, {"id": "mf2", "art": "guard", "x": 619, "y": 169, "k": "talk", "t": ["Guard: You're entering the Molten Frontier.", "Helix built their forge fortress at the top of the ridge. Watch yourself up there."]}, {"id": "mf3", "art": "explorer", "x": 488, "y": 653, "k": "talk", "t": ["Explorer: The hut here is a Recovery Hut. Rest up before you head into the lava fields.", "Weaken a wild Alienmon with a Tether Pulse, shock it with a Stun Spray, then fire the transfer beam!"]}, {"id": "mf4", "art": "pilgrim", "x": 488, "y": 653, "k": "trainer", "t": ["Pilgrim Sol: The island spirits test every traveler. Let's battle!"]}, {"id": "mf5", "art": "miner", "x": 705, "y": 322, "k": "talk", "t": ["Miner: That tunnel runs all the way under the sea to Sunset Canyon.", "The ground's been rumbling since Helix started digging."]}, {"id": "mf6", "art": "researcher", "x": 888, "y": 227, "k": "trainer", "t": ["Researcher Kel: Lava-forged Alienmon have incredible stats. Let me show you!"]}, {"id": "mf7", "art": "guard", "x": 1040, "y": 320, "k": "trainer", "t": ["Helix Grunt: Halt! This forge belongs to the Helix Directive!"]}, {"id": "mf8", "art": "technician", "x": 1450, "y": 262, "k": "talk", "t": ["Technician: This dish relays every signal in the Frontier.", "Lately it keeps catching a pulse from the Starfall crater. Same rhythm, every night."]}, {"id": "mf9", "art": "wanderer", "x": 930, "y": 433, "k": "talk", "t": ["Wanderer: The paths wind down the ridge to the Forge Gate and the shuttle pad.", "Wild Alienmon roam the trails between towns. Keep your team healthy."]}, {"id": "mf10", "art": "grub", "x": 960, "y": 560, "k": "trainer", "t": ["Bug Catcher Grub: Fire bugs! The hottest bugs! Battle me!"]}, {"id": "mf11", "art": "sporefolk", "x": 840, "y": 679, "k": "talk", "t": ["Sporefolk: Even here, spores find a way. The red blooms feed on lava heat."]}, {"id": "mf12", "art": "miner", "x": 895, "y": 717, "k": "trainer", "t": ["Forge Miner Dax: The gate's mine to guard. Beat me first!"]}, {"id": "mf13", "art": "strand", "x": 1400, "y": 700, "k": "talk", "t": ["Strand: Helix shuttles fly from this pad straight to the Starfall Rift.", "Whatever they're hauling out there, they don't want anyone to see."]}, {"id": "mf14", "art": "ystran", "x": 1360, "y": 236, "k": "talk", "t": ["Ystran echo: ...the mountain's heart burns like Ystra's dying sun...", "...the Magma Mines go deeper than anyone has dared..."]}]}